# label: alg:ch29-link
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch29.tex:93
# caption: Static link: resolve, lay out, and relocate

REQUIRE object set O, library set L, layout rules D
ENSURE linked image or diagnostic
build the symbol table: resolve definitions across O
extract needed archive members under the linker's search-order rules; update definitions and unresolved names until that search reaches closure
merge input sections into output sections per D
assign addresses honoring alignment and permissions
FORALL relocation r at place p naming symbol s DO
  compute value(s, p) per the relocation kind
  check overflow and permission for r
  write the patched bytes at p
END FOR
emit segments, symbol tables, and debug mappings

